   "widgets_values": [
    "Illusion Guidance pulls the blurred brightness of the image toward the pattern while the composition forms, so the model builds the scene around it, then fades out by noise level 0.6.\n\nQwen Image 2.1: strength 3, contrast 0.35. noise_shaping 0.5 makes it build organic shapes from real content. Set noise_shaping to 0 for text, checkerboards and QR codes, where it makes Qwen draw a flat graphic.\n\nSquint or step back to see the pattern."
